P18.2 adds ONE new test file (tests/unit/species/test_species_transport.cpp, 34 gtest
tests, counted from --gtest_list_tests at logs/11_focused_status_final.log) and two new
production translation units already present from P18.1 plus src/species/SpeciesTransport.cpp.
It also adds an OPT-IN parameter to P14's diffusion assembler, defaulting to the
pre-P18.2 behaviour, so every existing caller is bitwise unchanged -- measured at
logs/10_preservation_final.log: transport 22/22, transport characterization 3/3,
P14 migration 3/3, turbulence 246/246, thermal 163/163.

gtest_discover_tests registers ONE CTEST ROW PER GTEST TEST, so 34 rows are added to every
configuration. None matches the 5 frozen exclusion patterns, so selected rises by 34 too.
Skipped and DISABLED must NOT move: the new tests are neither.

